#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""LGBM Transition Model (5-Year Lookahead Prediction)
Train LightGBM on pre-split parquet files: train_early_sampled (2001-2014), 
earlystop_full (2015-2017), test_full (2018-2024). Final model trained on 2001-2014,
with temporal cross-validation to determine num_boost_round, evaluated on 2018-2019.
Uses isotonic calibration fitted on 2016-2017 predictions (capped at LAST_LABEL_YEAR).
Target: transition_01_win5 (5-year lookahead)

Features:
- Temporal Cross-Validation: 3 folds with different train/earlystop year splits
- Final Model: Uses average best_iteration from CV folds (no early stopping)
- Time-based Sample Weighting: Later training years get higher weights
  (Year 2001: weight 0.5, Year 2014: weight 1.0, linear interpolation in between)
- Right-Censoring Protection: All splits (train/earlystop/calibration/test) filtered to LAST_LABEL_YEAR
  (LAST_LABEL_YEAR = WDPA_LAST_YEAR - LOOKAHEAD_YEARS) to avoid evaluating on
  labels that don't have complete 5-year lookahead information
"""

